# Google Custom Search API Configuration
#
# To set up your Google Custom Search API:
# 1. Go to https://console.cloud.google.com/
# 2. Create a new project or select an existing one
# 3. Enable the "Custom Search API" in the API Library
# 4. Create credentials (API Key) in the Credentials section
# 5. Go to https://programmablesearchengine.google.com/
# 6. Create a new search engine or use an existing one
# 7. Get your Search Engine ID from the search engine settings
#
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in your actual values

GOOGLE_API_KEY=your_google_api_key_here
GOOGLE_SEARCH_ENGINE_ID=your_search_engine_id_here
